From 02a11f6e5227e698db79cf0ca688c7ea95879514 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NanoTurtle <nano@local>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:14:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(kernel): port Samsung KDP/RKP/DEFEX support for
 SM-S9280 DZH3

- add compat/samsung_kdp.c: KDP-aware cred commit/put (prepare_ro_creds,
  kdp_assign_pgd, kdp_usecount_dec_and_test, ucounts helpers)
- add compat/samsung_defex.c: DEFEX cred tuple sync + task_defex_enforce kprobe
- add no-patch-text mode (CONFIG_KSU_SAMSUNG_NO_PATCH_TEXT) for RKP targets
- RKP fallback: when dispatcher slot cannot be patched, register sucompat
  kprobes + __arm64_sys_setresuid kretprobe (manager fd delivery)
- ksud: stage daemon before module load, finish_install afterwards
- Kbuild: add KSU_VERSION_OVERRIDE knob

Verified on SM-S9280 S9280ZCS6DZH3: late-load works, manager shows
Working LKM / jailbreak mode, version 35171.
